    "body": "Here's an example of the kind of thing that should work with this PR and changes in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11818 that I'm preparing:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div>\r\n <template shadowrootmode=\"open\" marker=\"x\">\r\n  Stuff: <?marker>\r\n  <!-- time passes -->\r\n  <template for=\"x\">Hello World</template>\r\n </template>\r\n</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat's analogous to this style of sibling-patching not involving DSD:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div marker=\"x\">\r\n Stuff: <?marker>\r\n <!-- time passes -->\r\n <template for=\"x\">Hello World</template>\r\n</div>\r\n```",
